{
	"title": "Compléter une loi : trouver le paramètre p",
	"description": "Les probabilités de la loi s'expriment en fonction d'un réel p : écrire que leur somme vaut 1 et résoudre l'équation du premier degré",
	"grades": ["1_SPE"],
	"theme": "Probabilités",
	"domain": "Variables aléatoires",
	"subdomain": "Compléter une loi",
	"level": 2,
	"status": "draft",
	"delay": 60,
	"shared": {
		"blankDefaults": {
			"acceptDecimal": true
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "La loi de probabilité d'une variable aléatoire $X$ est donnée dans le tableau ci-dessous, où $p$ est un nombre réel.\n\n| $x_k$ | ${{u}}$ | ${{eval:u+s}}$ | ${{eval:u+s+t}}$ | ${{eval:u+s+t+w}}$ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| $P(X=x_k)$ | $p$ | ${{b}}p$ | ${{c}}p$ | ${{d}}p$ |\n\nRéponds par une fraction irréductible ou par un nombre décimal exact.\n\n$p=?$\n\n$P(X={{eval:u+s+t+w}})=?$",
			"variables": [
				{ "name": "u", "expression": "-4..1" },
				{ "name": "s", "expression": "1..3" },
				{ "name": "t", "expression": "1..3" },
				{ "name": "w", "expression": "1..3" },
				{ "name": "b", "expression": "2..6" },
				{ "name": "c", "expression": "2..6" },
				{ "name": "d", "expression": "2..6" }
			],
			"conditions": ["b != c", "c != d", "b != d"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:1/(1+b+c+d)}}"
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:d/(1+b+c+d)}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"La somme des probabilités vaut $1$ : $p+{{b}}p+{{c}}p+{{d}}p=1$, soit ${{eval:1+b+c+d}}p=1$.",
					"Donc $p=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:1/(1+b+c+d)}} }$.",
					"$P(X={{eval:u+s+t+w}})={{d}}p={{d}}\\times{{eval:1/(1+b+c+d)}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:d/(1+b+c+d)}} }$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "La loi de probabilité d'une variable aléatoire $X$ est donnée dans le tableau ci-dessous, où $p$ est un nombre réel.\n\n| $x_k$ | ${{u}}$ | ${{eval:u+s}}$ | ${{eval:u+s+t}}$ | ${{eval:u+s+t+w}}$ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| $P(X=x_k)$ | ${{eval:c/10;d}}$ | $p$ | ${{b}}p$ | ${{d}}p$ |\n\nRéponds par une fraction irréductible ou par un nombre décimal exact.\n\n$p=?$",
			"variables": [
				{ "name": "u", "expression": "-4..1" },
				{ "name": "s", "expression": "1..3" },
				{ "name": "t", "expression": "1..3" },
				{ "name": "w", "expression": "1..3" },
				{ "name": "c", "expression": "1..7" },
				{ "name": "b", "expression": "2..5" },
				{ "name": "d", "expression": "2..5" }
			],
			"conditions": ["b != d"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(10-c)/(10*(1+b+d))}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"La somme des probabilités vaut $1$ : ${{eval:c/10;d}}+p+{{b}}p+{{d}}p=1$, soit ${{eval:1+b+d}}p=1-{{eval:c/10;d}}={{eval:(10-c)/10;d}}$.",
					"Donc $p=\\dfrac{ {{eval:(10-c)/10;d}} }{ {{eval:1+b+d}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:(10-c)/(10*(1+b+d))}} }$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Un dé à ${{n}}$ faces, numérotées de $1$ à ${{n}}$, est truqué : la probabilité d'obtenir une face est proportionnelle à son numéro. Autrement dit, si $X$ désigne le numéro obtenu, $P(X=k)=k\\,p$ pour tout entier $k$ de $1$ à ${{n}}$, où $p$ est un nombre réel.\n\nRéponds par une fraction irréductible ou par un nombre décimal exact.\n\n$p=?$\n\n$P(X={{n}})=?$",
			"variables": [{ "name": "n", "expression": "4|6|8|10|12" }],
			"conditions": [],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:2/(n*(n+1))}}"
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:2/(n+1)}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"La somme des probabilités vaut $1$ : $p+2p+\\dots+{{n}}p=1$, soit $(1+2+\\dots+{{n}})\\,p={{eval:n*(n+1)/2}}\\,p=1$.",
					"Donc $p=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:2/(n*(n+1))}} }$.",
					"$P(X={{n}})={{n}}\\,p={{n}}\\times{{eval:2/(n*(n+1))}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:2/(n+1)}} }$."
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"testSpecs": [
		{
			"description": "v0 : p + 3p + 2p + 4p = 10p = 1 → p = 1/10, P = 2/5",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": { "u": "0", "s": "1", "t": "1", "w": "2", "b": "3", "c": "2", "d": "4" },
			"answers": ["\\frac{1}{10}", "\\frac{2}{5}"],
			"expected": { "status": "correct" }
		},
		{
			"description": "v0 : décimaux 0,1 et 0,4",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": { "u": "0", "s": "1", "t": "1", "w": "2", "b": "3", "c": "2", "d": "4" },
			"answers": ["0,1", "0,4"],
			"expected": { "status": "correct" }
		},
		{
			"description": "v0 : coefficient 1 de p oublié (9p = 1)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": { "u": "0", "s": "1", "t": "1", "w": "2", "b": "3", "c": "2", "d": "4" },
			"answers": ["\\frac{1}{9}", "\\frac{4}{9}"],
			"expected": { "status": "incorrect" }
		},
		{
			"description": "v0 : P(X=4) = 4/10 non simplifiée",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": { "u": "0", "s": "1", "t": "1", "w": "2", "b": "3", "c": "2", "d": "4" },
			"answers": ["\\frac{1}{10}", "\\frac{4}{10}"],
			"expected": { "status": "unoptimal_form", "constraintViolations": ["reducedFractions"] }
		},
		{
			"description": "v1 : 0,4 + p + 2p + 3p = 1 → p = 0,1",
			"variationIndex": 1,
			"variables": { "u": "0", "s": "1", "t": "1", "w": "2", "c": "4", "b": "2", "d": "3" },
			"answers": ["0,1"],
			"expected": { "status": "correct" }
		},
		{
			"description": "v1 : fraction 1/10",
			"variationIndex": 1,
			"variables": { "u": "0", "s": "1", "t": "1", "w": "2", "c": "4", "b": "2", "d": "3" },
			"answers": ["\\frac{1}{10}"],
			"expected": { "status": "correct" }
		},
		{
			"description": "v1 : 0,4 oublié (6p = 1)",
			"variationIndex": 1,
			"variables": { "u": "0", "s": "1", "t": "1", "w": "2", "c": "4", "b": "2", "d": "3" },
			"answers": ["\\frac{1}{6}"],
			"expected": { "status": "incorrect" }
		},
		{
			"description": "v1 : 0,6/6 laissé tel quel (forme non simplifiée)",
			"variationIndex": 1,
			"variables": { "u": "0", "s": "1", "t": "1", "w": "2", "c": "4", "b": "2", "d": "3" },
			"answers": ["\\frac{6}{60}"],
			"expected": { "status": "unoptimal_form", "constraintViolations": ["reducedFractions"] }
		},
		{
			"description": "v2 : dé à 6 faces → p = 1/21, P(X=6) = 2/7",
			"variationIndex": 2,
			"variables": { "n": "6" },
			"answers": ["\\frac{1}{21}", "\\frac{2}{7}"],
			"expected": { "status": "correct" }
		},
		{
			"description": "v2 : dé supposé équilibré (1/6 et 1/6)",
			"variationIndex": 2,
			"variables": { "n": "6" },
			"answers": ["\\frac{1}{6}", "\\frac{1}{6}"],
			"expected": { "status": "incorrect" }
		},
		{
			"description": "v2 : 6/21 non simplifiée",
			"variationIndex": 2,
			"variables": { "n": "6" },
			"answers": ["\\frac{1}{21}", "\\frac{6}{21}"],
			"expected": { "status": "unoptimal_form", "constraintViolations": ["reducedFractions"] }
		}
	],
